    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR4h0001-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">Principles:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">To commend the worthy and revere virtue</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">casts a lasting light for a thousand years;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">to honor the root and respect beginnings</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">naturally extends the meaning far and wide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">King Yuán of Chǔ accumulated benevolence and laid the foundation of virtue,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">opening up this territory;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">his virtuous customs and moral achievements</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">set an example for future generations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-06T23:38:59.246+09:00">The prosperity of his lineage</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">Shí Lóng 實隆 despised his ancestors;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">the fragrance and glory they left behind</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">flourished for a hundred generations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">Yet their mounds and tombs are overgrown,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">and their graves are untended.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">Thinking of the distant past,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">I am filled with enduring sorrow.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">It is said that in loving a person, one loves the tree;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">even the sweet pear tree should not be cut down.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">In pursuing and recognizing ruined tombs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">even the memory of Xìn Líng 信陵 should not be forgotten.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">How much more so for that which is the origin of continuous growth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">where the source of prosperity begins!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">Let five households near the tomb be exempted from labor</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">and permanently assigned to sweep and clean it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-6a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00">This may be implemented accordingly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4h0001_tls_036-7a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-09T19:45:06.678+09:00"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
